<h1>lookup</h1>

{{! `lookup` reads a property by a dynamic key — handy for parallel arrays. }}
<ul>
{{#each people}}
  <li>{{this}} lives in {{lookup ../cities @index}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

{{! Look a value up by a key held in another variable. }}
<p>Selected: {{lookup translations selected}}</p>

{{! Subexpression form: lookup feeding another helper / path. }}
<p>Nested: {{lookup (lookup matrix row) col}}</p>
